#: ../../../programming_guides/overview.md:1
msgid "Programming Guides Overview"
msgstr "编程指南概览"

#: ../../../programming_guides/overview.md:3
msgid ""
"This section provides a practical guide to writing high‑performance kernels "
"with Tile Language (tile‑lang). It mirrors the structure of a similar guide "
"in another project and adapts it to tile‑lang concepts and APIs."
msgstr ""
"本节提供了使用 Tile Language (tile‑lang) 编写高性能内核的实用指南。"
"它借鉴了另一个项目中类似指南的结构，并针对 tile‑lang 的概念和 API 进行了适配。"

#: ../../../programming_guides/overview.md:6
msgid "Audience: Developers implementing custom GPU/CPU kernels with tile‑lang"
msgstr "目标读者：使用 tile‑lang 实现自定义 GPU/CPU 内核的开发者"

#: ../../../programming_guides/overview.md:7
msgid ""
"Prereqs: Basic Python, NumPy/Tensor concepts, and familiarity with GPU "
"programming notions"
msgstr ""
"前置要求：具备基本的 Python 和 NumPy/张量概念知识，并熟悉 GPU "
"编程的基本概念"

#: ../../../programming_guides/overview.md:8
msgid ""
"Scope: Language basics, control flow, instructions, autotuning, and type "
"system"
msgstr "涵盖范围：语言基础、控制流、指令、自动调优以及类型系统"

#: ../../../programming_guides/overview.md:10
msgid "What You’ll Learn"
msgstr "你将学到的内容"

#: ../../../programming_guides/overview.md:11
msgid "How to structure kernels with TileLang’s core DSL constructs"
msgstr "如何使用 TileLang 核心 DSL 结构来组织内核"

#: ../../../programming_guides/overview.md:12
msgid "How to move data across global/shared/fragment and pipeline compute"
msgstr "如何在 global/shared/fragment 之间移动数据以及如何流水线化计算"

#: ../../../programming_guides/overview.md:13
msgid "How to apply autotuning to tile sizes and schedules"
msgstr "如何对 Tile 大小和调度进行自动调优"

#: ../../../programming_guides/overview.md:14
msgid "How to specify and work with dtypes in kernels"
msgstr "如何在内核中指定和使用数据类型"

#: ../../../programming_guides/overview.md:16
msgid "Suggested Reading Order"
msgstr "建议阅读顺序"

#: ../../../programming_guides/overview.md:17
msgid "Language Basics"
msgstr "语言基础"

#: ../../../programming_guides/overview.md:18
